+++ KARETA_84.171_REEXTRACT/docs/deployment/PLESK_INSTALL_84.171.md	2026-10-04 18:01:22.000000000 +0000
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+# KARETA 188.5.5.6.84.171 — Plesk install / design acceptance
+
+1. Make a Plesk file + database backup. Preserve the active private config and persistent storage; do not overwrite them from the ZIP.
+2. Upload the full 84.171 package into the application document root. Do not mix individual files from 84.170/84.171.
+3. Keep the 84.170 Plesk/nginx/PHP-FPM configuration, trusted proxy rules and gzip/static-cache directives unchanged.
+4. Run `php tools/package_verify.php`. It must report release `188.5.5.6.84.171` with zero failed files.
+5. Run `php tools/server_preflight.php`. Environment-only failures must be resolved before browser acceptance.
+6. Run `php tools/db_upgrade.php --apply`. Expected schema remains **138**; this release adds no migration.
+7. Verify `/api/provenance.php` reports asset version `188.5.5.6.84.171` and the exact fingerprint from `storage/deployment_manifest.json`.
+8. Verify `/asset_manifest.php` and response header `X-Kareta-Asset-Version` both report `188.5.5.6.84.171`. Do not start visual acceptance while any 84.170 CSS/JS is still requested.
+9. Confirm HTML/SW/manifest remain `no-store`, while versioned CSS/JS remain immutable as in 84.170.
+10. Start a fresh browser/WebView session. If an old Service Worker still controls the page, use the application's retry/recovery path once and confirm the new release-scoped cache namespace is active.
+11. Authenticated Master acceptance, first pass: Биржа → Заказы → График → Сообщество → Запчасти → Ещё → back. Confirm exactly six bottom destinations on phone and no `Сегодня`.
+12. Repeat the same route circle a second time. No menu disappearance, new skeleton loop, mixed-release asset request or route-load error is allowed.
+13. Responsive design acceptance:
+    - phone <=767: one-row six-item bottom nav, no horizontal page overflow, Exchange one card per row;
+    - tablet 768–1199: dedicated right rail, Exchange two columns where content fits, no phone dock;
+    - desktop >=1200: desktop header + right rail, bounded Master content, two substantial Exchange cards per row.
+14. Open/close filters, More/drawer, location popover, chat composer, booking continue controls and entity windows. Confirm sticky/overlay elements do not cover each other.
+15. Inspect `storage/logs/client_errors.log` plus nginx/PHP logs for 429/timeouts. This design release does not claim the transport root cause fixed.
+
+Do not delete legacy CSS files on the host during this acceptance. They are frozen migration inputs; retirement comes only after the visual two-pass proof.
diff -ruN KARETA_84.170_ORIGINAL/docs/design/CANON_84_171.md KARETA_84.171_REEXTRACT/docs/design/CANON_84_171.md
--- KARETA_84.170_ORIGINAL/docs/design/CANON_84_171.md	1970-01-01 00:00:00.000000000 +0000
