@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+# KARETA Design Canon — 84.171
+
+## Owners
+
+- `css/next/design_contract.css` — shared tokens and global layer scale.
+- `css/next/master_shell_canonical_84_143.css` — sole Master header/nav/frame owner (historical path retained for compatibility).
+- `css/next/master_surfaces.css` — Master route content geometry.
+- `css/next/master_ui_exchange_schedule_flattening.css` — Master Exchange component/layout.
+- `css/routes/master_runtime.css` — generated artifact, never edit directly.
+
+## Viewports
+
+- phone <=767px: six destinations in one bottom row; Exchange one column.
+- tablet 768–1199px: right navigation rail; dedicated tablet density.
+- desktop >=1200px: full desktop header + right workspace rail; bounded content; Exchange two columns.
+
+## Layer scale
+
+base 0 → content 1 → sticky 20 → shell 40 → nav 50 → FAB 60 → overlay 80 → modal 100 → toast 120 → debug 200.
+
+Canonical owner files may not use raw numeric `z-index`.
+
+## Legacy rule
+
+Recovery/restore/modernization/legacy files are frozen migration inputs. No new design work goes into them. Physical deletion requires successful phone/tablet/desktop two-pass host browser acceptance.
